1471:<section id="named-tool-calling">
1472:<h3>Named Tool Calling<a class="headerlink" href="#named-tool-calling" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
1473:<p>The OpenAI frontend supports named function calling, utilizing structured outputs in the vLLM backend and guided decoding in TensorRT-LLM backend. Users can specify one of the tools in <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">tool_choice</span></code> to force the model to select a specific tool for function calling.</p>
1478:<p>Example for making a named tool calling request:</p>
1479:<div class="highlight-python notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">json</span>
1494:<span class="n">available_tools</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">{</span><span class="s2">&quot;get_current_weather&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">get_current_weather</span><span class="p">,</span>
1504:<span class="n">tools</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">[</span>
1506:        <span class="s2">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">&quot;function&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span>
1507:        <span class="s2">&quot;function&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
1533:        <span class="s2">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">&quot;function&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span>
1534:        <span class="s2">&quot;function&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
1567:<span class="n">tool_choice</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">{</span><span class="s2">&quot;function&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span><span class="s2">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">&quot;get_n_day_weather_forecast&quot;</span><span class="p">},</span> <span class="s2">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">&quot;function&quot;</span><span class="p">}</span>
1577:<span class="n">tool_calls</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">client</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">chat</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">completions</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">create</span><span class="p">(</span>
1578:    <span class="n">messages</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">messages</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">model</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">model</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">tools</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">tools</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">tool_choice</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">tool_choice</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">max_completion_tokens</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">128</span>
