shotai\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Kimi-K2.6\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Kimi-K2.6 native multimodal agentic model with SGLang - reasoning, tool calling, and multimodal capabilities.\"},\"tag\":\"NEW\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6\"},{\"title\":\"Kimi-K2.5\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Kimi-K2.5 MoE model with SGLang - 1T total parameters, 32B active, step-by-step reasoning and tool calling capabilities.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5\"},{\"title\":\"Kimi-K2\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Kimi-K2 MoE model with SGLang - 1T total parameters, 32B active, step-by-step reasoning and tool calling capabilities.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Moonshotai/Kimi-K2\"},{\"title\":\"Kimi-Linear\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Kimi-Linear with SGLang - community contribution guide for Moonshot AI's Kimi-Linear model deployment.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Moonshotai/Kimi-Linear\"}]},{\"group\":\"MiniMax\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy MiniMax-M2.7 with SGLang on NVIDIA and AMD GPUs — model self-evolution, professional software engineering, and native agent teams.\"},\"tag\":\"NEW\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/MiniMax/MiniMax-M2.7\"},{\"title\":\"MiniMax-M2\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy MiniMax-M2 with SGLang - community contribution guide for MiniMax M2 model deployment.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/MiniMax/MiniMax-M2\"},{\"title\":\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy MiniMax-M2.5 with SGLang - community contribution guide for MiniMax M2.5 model deployment.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/MiniMax/MiniMax-M2.5\"}]},{\"group\":\"NVIDIA\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Nemotron3-Ultra\",\"description\":\"Deploy NVIDIA Nemotron3-Ultra with SGLang - 550B hybrid MoE model (55B active) with 1M context window, BF16/NVFP4 support, built for long-running autonomous agents.\",\"tag\":\"NEW\",\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/NVIDIA/Nemotron3-Ultra\"},{\"title\":\"Nemotron 3 Nano Omni\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Nano Omni multimodal MoE model with SGLang - text, image, video, and audio inputs with reasoning and tool calling.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/NVIDIA/Nemotron3-Nano-Omni\"},{\"title\":\"Nemotron3-Nano\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy NVIDIA Nemotron3-Nano 30B hybrid LLM with SGLang - MoE, Mamba2, and attention layers with BF16/FP8 precision options.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/NVIDIA/Nemotron3-Nano\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Nemotron3-Super\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy NVIDIA Nemotron3-Super with SGLang - 120B hybrid MoE model (12B active) with 1M context window optimized for multi-agent systems and tool use.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/NVIDIA/Nemotron3-Super\"}]},{\"group\":\"Ernie\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Ernie4.5\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Ernie4.5 with SGLang - community contribution guide for Baidu's Ernie 4.5 model deployment.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Ernie/Ernie4.5\"},{\"title\":\"Ernie4.5-VL\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Ernie4.5-VL vision-language model with SGLang - community contribution guide for Baidu's multimodal model.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Ernie/Ernie4.5-VL\"}]},{\"group\":\"StepFun\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Step-3.7-Flash (new)\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Step-3.7-Flash multimodal reasoning engine with SGLang.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/StepFun/Step-3.7-Flash\"},{\"title\":\"Step-3.5-Flash\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Step-3.5 reasoning engine with SGLang. \"},\"descripti